; helper theory for arity-redeclaration-across-load-rejected.kurt. Auto-discovered and run
; on its own too, so it needs a valid marker. The fact must be labelled (exported) so `P`'s
; arity actually survives the `load` boundary -- otherwise there would be nothing left for
; arity-conflict-helper-b.kurt's own `arity P 2` to conflict with once loaded afterward.
arity P 1
bool P
use P $x implies P $x  "trivial"
;;; Proof checked.
